{"type":"message","id":"47b212de","parentId":"c6eea939","timestamp":"2026-04-15T19:00:18.779Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Reflections: Theme: `user` kept surfacing across 79 memories.; confidence: 1.00; evidence: memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:1-1, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:3-3, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:5-5; note: reflection\n- Reflections: Theme: `assistant` kept surfacing across 73 memories.; confidence: 0.95; evidence: memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:2-2, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:4-4, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:6-6; note: reflection\n- Possible Lasting Truths: Assistant: [[reply_to_current]] ## ECHO 势体系技术文档总结 这是 **ECHO Shi Framework (势体系)** 的技术文档首页，介绍了该项目的核心组成部分： ### 核心模块 1. **势枢核心 v1.0** - 包含时间维、空间维、关系维三维编织的元结构定义，基础架构已确认 2. **势场聚类 v1.0** - 从势枢涌现出64个势场区域，使用DBSCAN聚类算法，每周进行测绘并以文化命名，核心机制已确认 3. **势位协议 v2.0** - 完成从设\n- User: Read HEARTBEAT.md if it exists (workspace context). Follow it strictly. Do not infer or repeat old tasks from prior chats. If nothing needs attention, reply HEARTBEAT_OK. When reading HEARTBEAT.md, use workspace file /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md (exact case).\n- Assistant: HEARTBEAT_OK\n- User: [cron:config-backup-8am config-backup-8am] 备份 openclaw.json：cp ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-$(date +%Y%m%d) && echo \"openclaw.json 备份完成 $(date)\" Current time: Wednesday, April 15th, 2026 - 8:00 AM (UTC) / 2026-04-15 08:00 UTC Return your summar\n- Assistant: openclaw.json 已备份至 ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-20260415\n- User: [cron:1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503 daily-backup] 执行备份：cd ~/.openclaw && git add -A && git commit -m \"auto backup $(date +\\%Y-\\%m-\\%d)\" && git push && echo \"备份完成\" Current time: Wednesday, April 15th, 2026 - 12:00 AM (UTC) / 2026-04-15 00:00 UTC Return your summary as\n- Assistant: ✅